POST /reservation

make(reservation:Reservation):Reservation

1) get userId from the SecurityContext
2) add the userId to the Reservation received in POST
3) save the reservation to the Reservation Repository
4) if the reservation.startDate is TODAY, start the rental (call the RES)
5) return the reservation with userId</y:NodeLabel>
